Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------
- android/app/src/debug/assets/sample/phoebe.wav (debug builds only; not in the release APK):
  copied from the sherpa-onnx Parakeet model archive (test_wavs/0.wav), believed to be LibriSpeech
  dev-clean utterance 2086-149220-0033 (identified by its transcript). LibriSpeech is licensed under
  CC BY 4.0: Vassil Panayotov, Guoguo Chen, Daniel Povey and Sanjeev Khudanpur, "LibriSpeech: an ASR
  corpus based on public domain audio books", ICASSP 2015.
- android/app/src/debug/assets/sample/*.wav other than phoebe.wav (debug builds only): machine-generated speech made
  with the Supertonic 3 text-to-speech model (OpenRAIL-M) by android/scripts/make-feature-clips.py.
- android/app/src/main/assets/selftest/sample.wav: machine-generated speech, made with the Supertonic 3
  text-to-speech model (OpenRAIL-M) by android/scripts/make-selftest-sample.py.

